  "title": {
    "zh": "while 循环",
    "en": "While Loops"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "每轮先检查条件",
    "en": "Check the condition before each turn"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "给芽芽的电池补到至少 4 格。每次先看当前电量，没达标就补 3 格，再检查一次。",
    "en": "Get Sprout’s battery to at least 4 units. Check the current charge first. If it is too low, add 3 and check again."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "execution": {
    "source": "charge = scan()\nwhile charge < 4:\n    charge = charge + 3\nsay(str(charge))",
    "whileLoop": {
      "threshold": 4,
      "increment": 3
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 0 格",
          "en": "Start with 0 units"
        },
        "input": 0,
        "expected": "6"
      },
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 4 格",
          "en": "Start with 4 units"
        },
        "input": 4,
        "expected": "4"
      },
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 2 格",
          "en": "Start with 2 units"
        },
        "input": 2,
        "expected": "5",
        "roundPredictions": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ],
        "predictions": [
          "2",
          "4",
          "5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 6 格",
          "en": "Start with 6 units"
        },
        "input": 6,
        "expected": "6",
        "roundPredictions": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ],
        "predictions": [
          "4",
          "6",
          "9"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "先问电量还够不够",
        "en": "Check the charge before acting"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "while charge < 4 先判断当前电量是不是低于 4 格。条件为 True 时，才进入缩进里的补电指令。",
        "en": "while charge < 4 checks whether the current charge is below 4 units. The indented charging command runs when the condition is True."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "补电后回到判断",
        "en": "Return to the condition after charging"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "每轮加 3 后，程序回到 while，用刚更新的电量检查一次。条件变成 False 时，退出循环，显示最终电量。",
        "en": "After adding 3, the program returns to while and tests the new charge. A False result ends the loop. The line after the loop displays the final charge."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "第一次检查就可以结束",
        "en": "The first check can end the loop"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "如果一开始就有 4 格，charge < 4 为 False。程序直接去显示 4 格，补电指令执行了零轮。",
        "en": "If the battery starts at 4, charge < 4 is False on the first check. The program displays 4 units. The charging command runs zero times."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "起始电量已经是 4 格，循环会补电几次？",
      "en": "The battery starts with 4 units. How many charging rounds run?"
    },
